"""Type stubs for kaos_nlp_core._rust.spans — typed result pyclasses.

These pyclasses replace the prior dict-shaped FFI boundary for hot per-result
emission paths (tokenizer, matchers, BM25). They are re-exported under their
unprefixed names from ``kaos_nlp_core.types`` so callers see the same shape
they did before (``from kaos_nlp_core.types import TokenSpan``).
"""

